  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/CarlosAguilellaIAlfonsoGranellGuanyadorsVoltaCampanaSuera.jpg\" style=\"height: 360px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Carlos Aguilella Pallar&eacute;s, nascut a Suera, ha sigut el guanyador, amb el mateix temps que Afonso Granell de la Cruz, de la I Volta a la Campana de Suera (<a href=\"http://observon.blogspot.com.es/2014/11/clasificaciones-volta-la-campana-de.html\" target=\"_blank\">Classificacions</a>).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/SofiaGarciaBardollGuanyadoraVoltaCampanaSuera.jpg\" style=\"height: 447px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La classificaci&oacute; femenina l&#39;ha encap&ccedil;alada Sofia Garcia Bardoll.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4983.jpg\" alt=\"img_4983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4984.jpg\" alt=\"img_4984\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4986.jpg\" alt=\"img_4986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4987.jpg\" alt=\"img_4987\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4988.jpg\" alt=\"img_4988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4989.jpg\" alt=\"img_4989\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/voltacampanasuera14/img_4990.jpg\" alt=\"img_4990\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4